<div class="blog-content">
<div class="paragraph"><span><strong>Dear Santa:</strong><br/>I got your letter when I was 4th grade, my father told me you said there is no more gift for Christmas, when I am 10. I was sad, because Santa dose not have enough money for big boy's gift. Thank you for the 3 gifts in last year.<br/><br/>This year, I wanna get a mBot, I don’t have the mBot, but my father has the mBot one, I am very good I behave well recently, I want you help me to ask my father to give me a mBot. </span><br/><span>Today is Christmas Eve , I’m very excited, every time I look forward to Christmas, because I want to see my wish come true.</span><br/><span>Best regards, </span><br/><span>Enzo</span></div> <div><div style="height: 0px; overflow: hidden; width: 100%;"></div> <hr class="styled-hr" style="width:100%;"/> <div style="height: 20px; overflow: hidden; width: 100%;"></div></div> <div class="paragraph"><span>這是我今年寫給聖誕老公公的信。信中說道，我在四年級的時候，我爸告訴我我已經沒有聖誕禮物了。</span><br/><span>今年我想要一台mBot，因為我用scratch來寫程式，scratch可以跟裡面的Arduino連接，就可以讓那台機器動。</span><br/><span>我爸不想讓我直接得到那台mBot，要我寫信給聖誕老公公，然後聖誕老公公同意，我爸才會送我mBot。</span><br/><span>我決定12/24寄出上面那篇英文信，希望聖誕老公公能收到我的信件，並且幫我說服爸爸。<br/><br/>​<font color="#2a2a2a">mBot</font></span><span><font color="#c23b3b">是一款可以體驗動手編輯程式、學習電子與機器人學的多功能解決方案﹐透過執行完整融合Scratch 2.0的mBlock﹐你可以使用藍芽或2.4G無線模組與mBot連線﹐而且容易組裝的特性﹐讓你在學習STEM上有無限可能。</font></span><br/><br/><span><font color="#2a2a2a">Arduino</font></span><span><font color="#c23b3b">是一個開放原始碼的單晶片微控制器，它使用了Atmel AVR單晶片，採用了開放原始碼的軟硬體平台，建構於簡易輸出/輸入（simple I/O）介面板，並且具有使用類似Java、C語言的Processing/Wiring開發環境。u</font></span></div>
</div>
