<div style="height: 20px; overflow: hidden;"></div></div> <div class="paragraph"><span>下午我們到高雄餐旅大學，我有到模擬倉裡去看看，機長室，超多按鈕的。</span><br/><br/><span>我們還到客艙去模擬機場服務，空姐是大學生，我得到了超多包餅乾。</span><br/><br/><span>第三天，我們在講推力與反作用力，我們還做了水火箭，吃完午餐後我門就到外面去試射，我開降落傘的計時器跟別人的不一樣，我的跑比較快，所以別人要轉三圈半，我只用轉兩圈，發射的過程是，先在瓶子裡裝八分之一的水，再用打氣筒打氣打到70PSi然後轉計時器（控制降落傘開啟的時間）然後按下發射，就飛出去了，如果發射角度是45度，大概可以飛100公尺，我覺得很好玩，這就是我對這個營隊的感覺。</span></div> <div class="wsite-video"><div class="wsite-video-wrapper wsite-video-height-282 wsite-video-align-left"> <div class="wsite-video-container" id="wsite-video-container-322484662702773764" style="margin: 10px 0 10px 0;"> <iframe allowfullscreen="true" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" id="video-iframe-322484662702773764" scrolling="no" src="../../about:blank"> </iframe> <script> 							document.getElementById("video-iframe-322484662702773764").style.opacity = 0; 							document.getElementById("wsite-video-container-322484662702773764").style.background = "none"; 							var videoIframe322484662702773764Content = '<!DOC'+'TYPE ht'+'ml>' 								+ '<he'+'ad>' 								+ '<scr'+'ipt type="text/javascript" src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/2.1.4/jquery.min.js">\x3C/script>' 								+ '<scr'+'ipt type="text/javascript" src="/www.weebly.com/weebly/apps/generateVideo.php?source=weebly&output=js&elementid=322484662702773764&user=2944166&ineditor=0&align=left&margintop=10px&marginbottom=10px&downloadable=0&height=282&video=2/9/4/4/2944166/水火箭發射_185.mp4&image=2/9/4/4/2944166/水火箭發射_185.jpg">\x3C/script>' 								+ '</he'+'ad>' 								+ '<bo'+'dy style="margin:0; padding: 0;border:none;overflow:hidden;">' 								+ '</bo'+'dy></ht'+'ml>'; 							setTimeout(function() { 								var videoIframe322484662702773764Actual =  document.getElementById("video-iframe-322484662702773764").contentDocument; 								videoIframe322484662702773764Actual.open().write(videoIframe322484662702773764Content); 								videoIframe322484662702773764Actual.close(); 							}, 500); 						</scri