<h2 class="wsite-content-title">第五天</h2> <span class="imgPusher" style="float:left;height:0px"></span><span style="display: table;width:auto;position:relative;float:left;max-width:100%;;clear:left;margin-top:0px;*margin-top:0px"><a><img alt="圖片" class="galleryImageBorder wsite-image" src="../../uploads/2/9/4/4/2944166/editor/170711-141621.jpg?1504000456" style="margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 10px; border-width:1px;padding:3px; max-width:100%"/></a><span class="wsite-caption" style="display: table-caption; caption-side: bottom; font-size: 90%; margin-top: -10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"></span></span> <div class="paragraph" style="display:block;">我們每天早餐都去買一條法國麵包，在那邊買只用一歐元，還有優葛是在那邊的家樂福買的，他們那邊的家樂福就等於便利商店，因為他們那邊的家樂福便利商店的東西都有賣，那邊也很多家樂福，而且他們那邊沒有便利商店。<br/><br/><span></span></div> <hr style="width:100%;clear:both;visibility:hidden;"/> <div><div style="height:20px;overflow:hidden"></div> <div id="125003794401647148-slideshow"></div>
