<h2 class="blog-title">
<a class="blog-title-link blog-link" href="../../blog/9040763.html">法國旅行</a>
</h2>
<p class="blog-date">
<span class="date-text">
		7/9/2017
	</span>
</p>
<p class="blog-comments">
<a class="blog-link" href="../../blog/9040763.html#comments">
<fb:comments-count href="../../blog/9040763.html"></fb:comments-count> <span class="fb_comment_count_label">評論</span>
</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class="blog-separator"> </div>
<div class="blog-content">
<div class="paragraph">我和爸爸媽媽還有奕森（小孩），奕森爸爸媽媽去。</div> <h2 class="wsite-content-title">第一天</h2> <div class="paragraph">第一天的時候，因為先從香港出發，然後再從台灣轉機飛到法國比較便宜，所以我們先住在香港等明天在飛去法國，我們去香港住的房間不大，但是也不擠，在香港水很貴，剛好那個飯店有附水，所以我們回飯店都會先裝水，出去也會，我發現香港人都很會講英文，那邊有很多中國遊客，而且很多賣珠寶的店，行動也很方便公車通常每兩分鐘，就會到站，但現在的雙層巴士已經不像以前英國的雙層巴士了。</div> <h2 class="wsite-content-title">第三天</h2> <div class="paragraph">我們在法國是住公寓，那間很大，我都會在客廳的桌子玩香港買的橡皮擦樂高。下面的幻燈片就是我們住的公寓</div> <div><div style="height:20px;overflow:hidden"></div> <div id="544282289867844856-slideshow"></div>
<script type="text/javascript">
(function(jQuery) {
function init() { window.wSlideshow && window.wSlideshow.render({elementID:"544282289867844856",nav:"none",navLocation:"top",captionLocation:"bottom",transition:"fade",autoplay:"1",speed:"5",aspectRatio:"auto",showControls:"true",randomStart:"false",images:[{"url":"2/9/4/4/2944166/170711-104944em513480.jpg","width":"400","height":"267","caption":"客廳"},{"url":"2/9/4/4/2944166/170711-105000em513481.jpg","width":"400","height":"267","caption":"客廳"},{"url":"2/9/4/4/2944166/170711-120755em513488_1.jpg","width":"400","height":"267","caption":"客廳"},{"url":"2/9/4/4/2944166/170711-105008em513482.jpg","width":"400","height":"267","caption":"客廳"},{"url":"2/9/4/4/2944166/170711-105149em513484.jpg","width":"400","height":"267","caption":"廚房"},{"url":"2/9/4/4/2944166/170711-121331em513490_1.jpg","width":"400","height":"267","caption":"浴室"},{"url":"2/9/4/4/2944166/170711-121312em513489_1.jpg","width":"400","height":"267","caption":"房間"},{"url":"2/9/4/4/2944166/170711-122239em513491.jpg","width":"400","height":"267","caption":"我和奕森玩的樣子"}]}) }
jQuery(document).ready(init);
})(window.jQuery)
</script>
<div style="height:20px;overflow:hidden"></div></div> <div class="paragraph">第三天我們去一個公園吃蛋糕，他附的湯匙看起來很樣鐵的，但其實是塑膠的，法國都很歡迎鴿子，我用滑板車趕鴿子，有一個法國小孩還來罵我，之後我就想說來玩鴿子好了，我就挖一點蛋糕，然後在樹旁邊邊吃邊掉屑屑，然後就走人，鴿子就一大群跑到那邊吃，我覺得很好玩。</div> <div><div class="wsite-multicol"><div class="wsite-multicol-table-wrap" style="margin:0 -15px;"> <table class="wsite-multicol-table"> <tbody class="wsite-multicol-tbody"> <tr class="wsite-multicol-tr"> <td class="wsite-multicol-col" style="width:50%; padding:0 15px;"> <div><div class="wsite-image wsite-image-border-none" style="padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:10px;text-align:left"> <a> <img alt="圖片" src="../../uploads/2/9/4/4/2944166/published/170711-171348em510011.jpg?1503905087" style="width:251;max-width:100%"/> </a> <div style="display:block;font-size:90%"></div> </div></div> </td> <td class="wsite-multicol-col" style="width:50%; padding:0 15px;"> <div><div class="wsite-image wsite-image-border-none" style="padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:center"> <a> <img alt="圖片" src="../../uploads/2/9/4/4/2944166/published/170711-171958em129453.jpg?1503905067" style="width:auto;max-width:100%"/> </a> <div style="display:block;font-size:90%"></div> </div></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div></div></div> <h2 class="wsite-content-title">第四天</h2> <div class="paragraph">第四天我們去羅浮宮，他的外面有一個金字塔，金字塔式羅浮宮的路口，羅浮宮裡有分很多區，有一區我最喜歡，因為我覺得他們雕的很像。</div> <div><div style="height:20px;overflow:hidden"></div> <div id="784483183924660592-slideshow"></div>
